      {
        "id": 28593,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-01T18:41:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think that part of her self redemption was in part to eliminate all her self doubts. The only way to move forward, for her at least, was to shed all doubt and shame and become fully commited to her goal.&nbsp;</p><p>I think redeemer Fanatic is much more confident in her faith, hence the armor. I think the blindfold might be more symbolic of her not being swayed anymore by those like Apostate. Maybe you can call it her being more \"bind faith\" like I guess. But she will no longer be torn or distracted from her righteous path by others</p>",
        "post_number": 127,
        "post_type": 1,
