      {
        "id": 28598,
        "name": "TheTroll",
        "username": "TheTroll",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thetroll/{size}/2690_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-05-16T07:22:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I see Absolute Zero as a guy that since he can't actually get close to people anymore chooses to be a jerk to them to keep them away, sort of a coping mechanism to avoid getting emotionally hurt. However I think it's worked too well and he's forgotten that he's not just a jerk. It happens. Becoming the Mask and all that.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Nightmist I get a heavy Harry Dresden vibe from. Kinda snarky and fun to be around even if a bit cynical at times. I would love to party with her and Expatriette, but then again, I like the strong women.</p>",
